[{"text": "I give the floor to his excellency Subra", "start": 4.96, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "Hammer Ja Shankra,", "start": 9.679, "duration": 8.601}, {"text": "Minister of External Affairs of India.", "start": 12.4, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 32.88, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "excellencies,", "start": 34.88, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen, namaskar", "start": 36.399, "duration": 9.0}, {"text": "from 1.4 billion people of Bhat.", "start": 39.92, "duration": 5.479}, {"text": "We are gathered at this general assembly", "start": 46.399, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "when the United Nations enters its ninth", "start": 49.92, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "decade.", "start": 53.44, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "It was founded to maintain international", "start": 55.039, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "peace and security", "start": 57.92, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and take effective collective action", "start": 60.239, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "to that end.", "start": 63.92, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Members committed to develop friendly", "start": 66.32, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "relations and to strengthen universal", "start": 69.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "peace.", "start": 72.08, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Yet even as we meet, conflicts and", "start": 73.92, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "confrontations", "start": 78.4, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "remain our primary preoccupation.", "start": 80.0, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "The inability to maintain peace is not", "start": 83.439, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "just undermining security but", "start": 86.96, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "threatening progress and retarding", "start": 89.759, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "development.", "start": 92.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "In a globalized world, the effects of", "start": 94.079, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "war are felt worldwide.", "start": 97.2, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "Countries far from conflicts are being", "start": 102.0, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "penalized for no fault of theirs. Those", "start": 105.36, "duration": 8.799}, {"text": "most impacted often have the least say.", "start": 109.439, "duration": 8.801}, {"text": "This assembly must face up to the true", "start": 114.159, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "state of affairs.", "start": 118.24, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "This year we are witnessing a conflict", "start": 121.28, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "in the Gulf, one that is exacerbating an", "start": 124.32, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "already difficult situation.", "start": 128.399, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "We remain deeply concerned over", "start": 130.959, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "continuing hostilities.", "start": 133.28, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "The targeting of commercial shipping and", "start": 135.76, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "seafarers,", "start": 138.0, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "transiting international waterways is", "start": 139.68, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "simply unacceptable.", "start": 142.239, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "India calls upon all parties to exercise", "start": 144.64, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "restraint, deescalate tensions, ensure", "start": 148.4, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "protection of civilians and", "start": 152.16, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "uninterrupted flow of energy and", "start": 154.4, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "commerce.", "start": 157.36, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 159.04, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "the conflict in Ukraine now in its fifth", "start": 161.04, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "year is equally concerning.", "start": 164.239, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "As Prime Minister Narendra Modi stated,", "start": 167.68, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "endless war must give way now to an end", "start": 170.72, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "to war. India supports ongoing", "start": 174.4, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "initiatives to bring peace. Even as this", "start": 178.0, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "is underway, there is an urgent need to", "start": 181.519, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "address the security of seafareders and", "start": 185.12, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "supply of food, grains and energy.", "start": 188.4, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "India is prepared to do everything", "start": 192.879, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "possible to amilarate this situation", "start": 195.599, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "especially with regard to food and", "start": 199.12, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "energy security.", "start": 202.879, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "Tensions and violence also regrettably", "start": 206.159, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "continue in West Asia or the Middle", "start": 209.28, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "East. We strongly believe that a durable", "start": 211.92, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "and lasting peace requires a two-state", "start": 216.08, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "solution.", "start": 219.68, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "In the meanwhile, India is contributing", "start": 221.2, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "to humanitarian assistance and relief", "start": 224.4, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "efforts for the Palestinian people.", "start": 227.28, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 230.799, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "let us recognize that peace is not just", "start": 232.72, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "the absence of war.", "start": 236.72, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "If the world is subjected to continuous", "start": 239.04, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "threats and pressures, then we are", "start": 241.519, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "really living on the edge of an abyss.", "start": 244.319, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "All it takes is one more step to push us", "start": 247.84, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "over.", "start": 251.68, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Therefore, it is imperative to", "start": 253.36, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "strengthen stability, security, and", "start": 255.84, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "predictability.", "start": 259.04, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "These are crucial elements of the", "start": 260.799, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "enabling environment for peace. If any", "start": 263.199, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "of them are undermined, peace will", "start": 266.88, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "inevitably be weakened.", "start": 270.96, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "After eight decades of the UN, this", "start": 274.32, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "should have become a second nature.", "start": 276.96, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "Instead, what we are actually seeing is", "start": 280.56, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "a weaponization of everything.", "start": 284.56, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "A mindset of extreme competition has set", "start": 287.84, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "in, undermining institutions and", "start": 291.04, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "establishing choke points. It extends", "start": 294.24, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "from the world of finance to", "start": 297.52, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "constricting market access, disrupting", "start": 299.84, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "supply chains and withholding", "start": 302.88, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "technology.", "start": 304.96, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Resources and connectivity have become", "start": 306.8, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "particularly subject to leveraging.", "start": 309.919, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "As a result, nations are now more", "start": 313.52, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "focused on d-risking and diversifying.", "start": 316.72, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "Now, while this may secure their", "start": 320.72, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "interest to varying degrees, the overall", "start": 322.479, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "atmosphere is no longer that of trust or", "start": 325.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "goodwill.", "start": 329.84, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "Mr. President, the predicament of the", "start": 331.68, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "global south is particularly acute.", "start": 334.479, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "It faces a 4F crisis", "start": 337.919, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "of the security of food, fuel,", "start": 341.199, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "fertilizer, and finance.", "start": 344.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "The combined impact of a super El Nino,", "start": 347.68, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "compounding fertilizer shortages and now", "start": 351.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "impediments to grain movements. All", "start": 354.96, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "these are cause for alarm.", "start": 357.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Moreover, SG progress is under", "start": 361.52, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "increasing pressure. The global south's", "start": 364.56, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "right to industrialize is also", "start": 367.84, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "undermined by non-market practices and", "start": 370.319, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "market denial. The march of technology", "start": 373.759, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "that was meant to instill hope has now", "start": 377.44, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "become a source of anxiety.", "start": 380.56, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "Misuse of AI is sharpening bias and", "start": 383.44, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "diluting mutual respect.", "start": 387.6, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "These directions bode ill for the aims", "start": 390.72, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "and objectives of the United Nations.", "start": 394.4, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "A persistent threat to peace has been", "start": 399.12, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "the scourge of terrorism.", "start": 402.08, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "That this could be state sponsored", "start": 404.639, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "with crossber purpose makes it a direct", "start": 407.52, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "affront to the global order. Governments", "start": 411.6, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "indulging in such practices must be held", "start": 415.36, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "accountable. There must be no dilution", "start": 418.56, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "in our zero tolerance approach towards", "start": 422.0, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "terrorism. Its financial aspects in", "start": 424.8, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "particular should be exposed and should", "start": 428.319, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "be countered.", "start": 431.12, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Mr. President, yesterday a serial", "start": 433.84, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "practitioner of terrorism misrepresented", "start": 437.84, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "facts before this assembly.", "start": 441.039, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "Arguments were invoked to normalize", "start": 443.84, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "terrorism and claim immunity from its", "start": 446.56, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "consequences.", "start": 449.919, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "That will not stand. Our right to defend", "start": 451.52, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "ourselves against terrorism will be", "start": 454.88, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "exercised. Mr. President, friendship and", "start": 458.08, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "goodwill cannot coexist with terrorism", "start": 462.24, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "and understandings premised on that will", "start": 465.759, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "naturally be called into question.", "start": 469.199, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "It is for the perpetrator of terrorism", "start": 472.88, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "to mend its ways.", "start": 475.599, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "Mr. President given the state of the", "start": 478.319, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "world each member of the UN must ask", "start": 481.12, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "themselves what they can do in so far as", "start": 484.639, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "India is concerned its inclusive growth", "start": 488.879, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "and all round progress has advanced the", "start": 492.16, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "prospects of one sixth of humanity when", "start": 495.199, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "health nutrition and education are", "start": 498.56, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "effectively delivered when drinking", "start": 501.44, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "water electricity roads and housing are", "start": 503.919, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "insured. This veritably lifts the global", "start": 506.96, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "SDG outcomes.", "start": 510.96, "duration": 5.999}, {"text": "But today, India has much more than that", "start": 513.919, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "to offer. Our digital public", "start": 516.959, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "infrastructure is not only ensuring", "start": 519.36, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "better governance but is the backbone of", "start": 521.919, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "delivering socioeconomic benefits. Rapid", "start": 525.2, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "growth of infrastructure is visible", "start": 529.6, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "across all its dimensions.", "start": 532.48, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "A continuously improving ease of doing", "start": 535.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "business, ease of living, startup and", "start": 537.519, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "innovation culture and focused sectoral", "start": 540.56, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "missions have all contributed to our", "start": 543.279, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "economic story.", "start": 546.32, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Even as India progresses, we are", "start": 548.72, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "conscious of our global", "start": 551.279, "duration": 3.201}, {"text": "responsibilities.", "start": 552.88, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "We know that many of our experiences and", "start": 554.48, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "achievements are replicable elsewhere.", "start": 557.279, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "The deep solidarity of the global south", "start": 560.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "has always encouraged us to share what", "start": 563.839, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "we have. Therefore, we respond more", "start": 567.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "actively to the requirements of our", "start": 570.72, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "partners.", "start": 573.04, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "600 major Indian development projects in", "start": 574.8, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "78 nations testify to our commitment. A", "start": 577.839, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "commitment that ranges from", "start": 581.76, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "infrastructure, manufacturing, and", "start": 583.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "agriculture to IT and to capacity", "start": 585.519, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "building.", "start": 588.48, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Climate action projects and initiatives", "start": 590.64, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "have been an important part of these", "start": 594.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "endeavors. Whether it is clean energy", "start": 596.399, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "and clean water projects, sustainable", "start": 599.36, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "agriculture, or the dissemination of", "start": 602.16, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "best practices and technology, our", "start": 605.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "capabilities and experiences have been", "start": 607.68, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "reflected abroad.", "start": 610.56, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "African nations and small island", "start": 612.64, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "developing states have been our", "start": 615.12, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "preferred partners in this journey.", "start": 617.12, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Initiatives like the international solar", "start": 620.32, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "alliance, the coalition for disaster", "start": 623.04, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "resilient infrastructure or the global", "start": 625.6, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "bofuels alliance are all making steady", "start": 628.24, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "progress.", "start": 631.519, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Mr. President, the turbulence of our", "start": 633.36, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "times also demands more from each of us.", "start": 636.32, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "India has sent medical shipments to", "start": 640.56, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "conflict zones, epidemic locations and", "start": 642.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "after natural disasters. As a first", "start": 646.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "responder, we were there early. Be it", "start": 649.44, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "the Nepal flash floods or the Venezuela", "start": 652.72, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "earthquake, our limb fitment camps have", "start": 655.519, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "given a new hope to many across the", "start": 659.04, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "world.", "start": 662.32, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "Whether to meet food and medicine", "start": 664.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "shortages, energy or fertilizer needs or", "start": 666.079, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "indeed creating livelihoods, India has", "start": 669.76, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "contributed continuously and will do so.", "start": 673.6, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Our capacity building and experience", "start": 677.2, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "sharing programs have made a real", "start": 679.2, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "difference across the global south,", "start": 682.079, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "especially in Africa.", "start": 684.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "The same international spirit also", "start": 687.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "inspires our contribution to", "start": 690.72, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "safeguarding peace. India has always", "start": 693.36, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "been at the forefront of UN peacekeeping", "start": 697.36, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "operations. Right now, our contingents", "start": 699.839, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "are present in nine out of 11 mandates.", "start": 703.279, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "Our troops have stood their ground", "start": 707.519, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "firmly and professionally, even under", "start": 709.92, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "pressure. We take pride that an Indian", "start": 713.279, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "woman combat helicopter pilot was", "start": 717.2, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "awarded the UN 2025 military gender", "start": 720.16, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "advocate of the year.", "start": 724.399, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 728.0, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "new challenges in the maritime domain", "start": 729.92, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "have added to longstanding ones on land.", "start": 732.639, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "There have been attacks on commercial", "start": 736.639, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "shipping and seafarers in the Gulf and", "start": 738.399, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "from the Red Sea to the Black Sea.", "start": 741.36, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Indian seafarers have lost their lives", "start": 744.399, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "as indeed have others from other", "start": 748.16, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "nations.", "start": 750.639, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "This is completely unacceptable.", "start": 752.24, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "India has joined Liberia and 23 other", "start": 755.12, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "partners in an initiative to rally", "start": 758.399, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "global public opinion against such", "start": 761.519, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "unwarranted targeting.", "start": 764.0, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "We must ensure that the safety and", "start": 766.56, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "security of shipping and seafooders is", "start": 769.519, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "never compromised.", "start": 772.32, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "Scruplessly observing international law", "start": 774.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "is an integral element of that India", "start": 777.519, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "work.", "start": 780.0, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "An issue central to current global", "start": 782.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "conversations is that of AI. India", "start": 784.72, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "hosted the AI impact summit this", "start": 788.72, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "February gathering together the best", "start": 791.519, "duration": 8.481}, {"text": "minds on that subject. We view AI as a", "start": 794.88, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "transformational driver for human", "start": 800.0, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "empowerment, economic prosperity and", "start": 802.48, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "population scale problem solving. We", "start": 805.76, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "believe in the right of each nation to", "start": 808.959, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "shape its ecosystem", "start": 811.44, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "within the de with the development of", "start": 813.6, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "its own models and deployment strategies", "start": 816.24, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "consistent with its national goals and", "start": 819.519, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "priorities. AI will be very much part of", "start": 822.16, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "a partnership agenda with the global", "start": 826.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "south", "start": 828.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "as technology is democratized. This", "start": 831.68, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "process is greatly facilitated. Mr.", "start": 834.48, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "president by an ethos of mutual respect.", "start": 837.519, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "Indeed, care and consideration for the", "start": 841.279, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "interests and viewpoints of others", "start": 844.24, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "reinforces even the prospects of peace.", "start": 846.56, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "And that attitude is best fostered by an", "start": 850.079, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "appreciation of each other's culture,", "start": 853.68, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "heritage, and traditions. In a", "start": 856.56, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "globalized world, we must continuously", "start": 859.199, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "and vigorously promote international", "start": 862.399, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "understanding. Economic rebalancing is", "start": 865.04, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "well underway. The political one is also", "start": 868.079, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "visible. And the third facet, cultural", "start": 870.88, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "rebalancing must now be taken forward.", "start": 874.56, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 877.92, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "we are now well on our way towards a", "start": 879.839, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "multipolar world. The post 1945 order is", "start": 882.8, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "giving way to new realities.", "start": 887.6, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "This process of adjustment,", "start": 890.48, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "accommodation, and acceptance will not", "start": 892.639, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "be easy. Much of the turbulence that we", "start": 895.44, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "witness today emanates from those very", "start": 898.72, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "difficulties.", "start": 901.839, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Yet, the march of an intrinsically", "start": 903.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "diverse world towards a more democratic", "start": 906.639, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "future cannot be halted. Peace in a", "start": 909.44, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "pluralistic order requires civil", "start": 913.839, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "conversations. It requires broad-based", "start": 916.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "consultations. It requires transparent", "start": 919.839, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "decision making. Large sections of", "start": 922.88, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "humanity cannot be excluded from that", "start": 925.92, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "process. The case for reformed", "start": 929.36, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "multilateralism", "start": 931.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "only gets stronger day after day.", "start": 933.519, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "Mr. President, after a decade of service", "start": 937.36, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "and dedication to the cause of", "start": 941.36, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "multilateralism,", "start": 943.04, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "we will soon bid farewell to Secretary", "start": 944.56, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "General Antonio Gutirez.", "start": 947.44, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "India deeply values his many", "start": 950.48, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "contributions, in particular his", "start": 952.399, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "personal support for mission life.", "start": 955.199, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "Mr. President, at the conclusion of this", "start": 958.959, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "general debate, we hope that all", "start": 961.92, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "participating delegations leave with a", "start": 965.279, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "greater commitment to peace, to", "start": 968.079, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "development, and to prosperity. This", "start": 970.32, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "cannot be an imposition", "start": 973.36, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "or even a negotiation. It must be a", "start": 975.92, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "mindset. It must be an outlook. It must", "start": 979.279, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "be a belief.", "start": 982.399, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "In the lawns outside this building are", "start": 984.16, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "recorded the powerful words of Mahatma", "start": 987.04, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "Gandhi and that should serve as an", "start": 989.44, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "inspiration for these times and those", "start": 991.759, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "words are that there is no way to peace.", "start": 994.639, "duration": 9.241}, {"text": "Peace is the way. I thank you.", "start": 998.48, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "I thank the Minister of External Affairs", "start": 1016.88, "duration": 8.04}, {"text": "of India for his contribution.", "start": 1020.399, "duration": 4.521}]